<title>FRANCE: Club Med suspended limit up.</title>
<headline>Club Med suspended limit up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Club Mediterrannee were suspended limit up on Monday morning and an attempt at requoting would be made at 0915 GMT, the French Bourses' Association SBF said.</p>
<p>The SBF set an upper limit of 410.50 francs and a lower limit of 371.5 francs.</p>
<p>Club Med was suspended on Friday when it announced 1996 losses and a new chairman.</p>
